(4409, 272, 'What does early stopping prevent?', 'Overfitting by halting training when validation stops improving', 'Data loading', 'Weight updates', 'Feature selection', 'A', 'Early stopping keeps the best validation model.', 'ADVANCED', 3, 'MCQ', 1),
